    "title": "Oregon researchers, crabbers team up to solve deadly whale entanglements - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ethan Quin ,\n12 hours ago NEWPORT, Ore. – A juvenile humpback whale was found last November stranded on an Oregon beach, outside Yachats, with fishing gear in its mouth. Its euthanization has reignited a conversation on the coast. At stake is the coexistence of the state’s most lucrative fishery and its recovering whale populations. While the sight of a stranded whale is tragic, it highlights a complex problem that scientists and crabbers are actively working to solve together. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
